msgstr "变量"

msgid "Robust Effect Sizes"
msgstr "稳健效应量"

msgid "ξ is the Algina-Keselman-Penfield robust standardised mean difference (WRS2::akp.effect)."
msgstr "ξ 是 Algina-Keselman-Penfield 稳健标准化均值差（WRS2::akp.effect）。"

msgid "Robust effect sizes are only computed for one-way designs."
msgstr "稳健效应量仅对单因素设计计算。"

msgid "Need at least two factor levels to compute pairwise effect sizes."
msgstr "计算成对效应量至少需要两个因子水平。"

