msgstr "加载数据时出错：%s"

msgid "Robust repeated measures ANOVA currently supports only one within-subjects factor."
msgstr "稳健重复测量方差分析目前仅支持一个组内因子。"

msgid "Robust repeated measures ANOVA currently supports at most one between-subjects factor."
msgstr "稳健重复测量方差分析目前最多支持一个组间因子。"

msgid "Median-based robust analysis is not currently supported for repeated measures designs. Please select Trimmed Means or Trimmed Means + Bootstrap."
msgstr ""
"重复测量设计目前不支持基于中位数的稳健分析。请选择修剪均值或修剪均值 + "
"Bootstrap。"

msgid "Bootstrap mixed RM ANOVA failed:\n%s"
msgstr ""
"Bootstrap 混合重复测量方差分析失败：\n"
"%s"

msgid "Mixed RM ANOVA failed: %s"
msgstr "混合重复测量方差分析失败：%s"

msgid "Robust RM ANOVA failed: %s"
msgstr "稳健重复测量方差分析失败：%s"

msgid "Robust Repeated Measures ANOVA"
msgstr "稳健重复测量方差分析"

msgid "Bootstrap with trimmed means (%.0f%% trimming, %d bootstrap samples)."
msgstr "使用修剪均值的 Bootstrap（%.0f%% 修剪，%d 个 Bootstrap 样本）。"

msgid "Reject H₀ if the test statistic exceeds the critical value %.3f (α = .05); no p-value is reported by this bootstrap procedure."
msgstr ""
"如果检验统计量超过临界值 %.3f（α = .05），则拒绝 H₀；此 Bootstrap 过程不报告 "
"p 值。"

msgid "Trimmed means (%.0f%% trimming)."
msgstr "修剪均值（%.0f%% 修剪）。"

msgid "Robust post hoc tests are only available for within-subjects factors."
msgstr "稳健事后检验仅适用于组内因子。"

msgid "Post hoc tests failed: %s"
msgstr "事后检验失败：%s"

